          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Get in touch to book a sound bath, private session, or ask questions about our offerings in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg-1:#FFF8F1; /* warm cream */\\n      --bg-2:#F3E7D9; /* soft tan */\\n      --accent-1:#8B5E34; /* warm brown */\\n      --accent-2:#C07A52; /* terracotta */\\n      --muted:#6B5E55; /* neutral text */\\n      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\\n      --card-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(136,95,64,0.12);\\n      --radius:14px;\\n      font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial;\\n    }\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg-1) 0%,var(--bg-2) 100%);color:var(--muted);}\\n    /* Background SVG as layered element */\\n    .bg-svg{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:0;opacity:0.9;pointer-events:none}\\n\\n    header{position:relative;z-index:10;padding:28px 32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\\n    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent-2),var(--accent-1));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700;font-size:18px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(192,122,82,0.22)}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin:0 10px;font-weight:600}\\n    nav a.cta{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent-2),var(--accent-1));color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700}\\n\\n    main{position:relative;z-index:5;max-width:1100px;margin:28px auto;padding:32px}\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:26px;align-items:start}\\n    .hero-card{background:var(--glass);backdrop-filter: blur(6px);padding:28px;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--card-shadow)}\\n    .eyebrow{color:var(--accent-1);font-weight:700}\\n    h1{font-size:34px;margin:8px 0 10px;color:#4A3426}\\n    p.lead{margin:0 0 18px;color:#6E5447}\\n\\n    .contact-panel{padding:22px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.7),rgba(255,255,255,0.55));box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(139,94,52,0.06)}\\n    .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;margin-bottom:12px}\\n    label{font-size:13px;margin-bottom:6px;color:#5A463A}\\n    input,textarea,select{padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(106,86,72,0.08);font-size:15px}\\n    textarea{min-height:120px}\\n    .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent-2),var(--accent-1));color:white;border:0;font-weight:700}\\n    .muted-note{font-size:13px;color:#7A6458}\\n\\n    section{margin-top:28px}\\n    .grid-3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}\\n    .card{background:white;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(98,70,52,0.06)}\\n    .pillars li{margin-bottom:10px}\\n\\n    .case-notes{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n    .testimonial{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#FFF9F6,#FFF6F1);border-left:4px solid var(--accent-2)}\\n\\n    footer{margin:36px auto 80px;max-width:1100px;padding:20px 32px;color:#6A5448}\\n\\n    /* responsive */\\n    @media (max-width:900px){\\n      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n      nav{display:none}\\n    }\\n\\n    /* playful decorative dots */\\n    .dots{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}\\n    .dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--accent-1),var(--accent-2))}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <!-- decorative SVG background - unique pattern -->\\n  <svg class=\\\"bg-svg\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 1200 800\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"xMidYMid slice\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n    <defs>\\n      <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n        <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#FFF7F1\\\"/>\\n        <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#F6E7DC\\\"/>\\n      </linearGradient>\\n      <pattern id=\\\"p1\\\" width=\\\"120\\\" height=\\\"120\\\" patternUnits=\\\"userSpaceOnUse\\\" patternTransform=\\\"rotate(18)\\\">\\n        <rect width=\\\"120\\\" height=\\\"120\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\"/>\\n        <g opacity=\\\"0.06\\\" fill=\\\"#8B5E34\\\">\\n          <circle cx=\\\"20\\\" cy=\\\"20\\\" r=\\\"3\\\"/>\\n          <circle cx=\\\"60\\\" cy=\\\"80\\\" r=\\\"2.6\\\"/>\\n          <rect x=\\\"10\\\" y=\\\"60\\\" width=\\\"6\\\" height=\\\"18\\\" rx=\\\"2\\\"/>\\n          <path d=\\\"M100 10c-12 6-28 28-34 42\\\" stroke=\\\"#8B5E34\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.8\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\"/>\\n        </g>\\n      </pattern>\\n      <filter id=\\\"soft\\\" x=\\\"-20%\\\" y=\\\"-20%\\\" width=\\\"140%\\\" height=\\\"140%\\\">\\n        <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\\\"28\\\" result=\\\"b\\\"/>\\n        <feBlend in=\\\"SourceGraphic\\\" in2=\\\"b\\\" mode=\\\"normal\\\"/>\\n      </filter>\\n    </defs>\\n    <rect width=\\\"1200\\\" height=\\\"800\\\" fill=\\\"url(#p1)\\\"/>\\n    <g filter=\\\"url(#soft)\\\" opacity=\\\"0.55\\\">\\n      <ellipse cx=\\\"950\\\" cy=\\\"80\\\" rx=\\\"380\\\" ry=\\\"160\\\" fill=\\\"#C07A52\\\"/>\\n      <ellipse cx=\\\"120\\\" cy=\\\"700\\\" rx=\\\"280\\\" ry=\\\"120\\\" fill=\\\"#8B5E34\\\"/>\\n    </g>\\n  </svg>\\n\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"logo\\\">SB</div>\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:800;color:#4A3426\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:#7A6458\\\">A sensory sound practice in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <nav aria-label=\\\"Main navigation\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"events.html\\\">Gatherings</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"private-sessions.html\\\">Sessions</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Investment</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">Our Story</a>\\n      <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Connect</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main>\\n    <div class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"hero-card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">Reach out & center</div>\\n        <h1>Let's plan your next sound journey</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Whether you\\u2019re curious about a group sound bath at {{VENUE_NAME}}, want a private 1:1, or are booking an intensive immersion, we\\u2019re here to help design a resonant experience that fits your needs.</p>\\n\\n        <section aria-labelledby=\\\"what-to-bring\\\">\\n          <h3 id=\\\"what-to-bring\\\">What to bring</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted-note\\\">A small checklist to arrive prepared and comfortable.</p>\\n          <ul class=\\\"pillars\\\">\\n            <li>Yoga mat or meditation cushion (we provide limited mats)</li>\\n            <li>Blanket & light pillow for comfort and warmth</li>\\n            <li>Water bottle (stay hydrated before and after)</li>\\n            <li>Optional eye mask and ear plugs for deeper focus</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <section aria-labelledby=\\\"flow\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">\\n          <h3 id=\\\"flow\\\">How a session flows</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted-note\\\">A gentle roadmap of a typical offering.</p>\\n          <ol>\\n            <li>Welcome & intention setting (5\\u201310 min) \\u2014 arrivals, grounding, and breathwork.</li>\\n            <li>Sound immersion (30\\u201360 min) \\u2014 layered instruments create waves of tone and silence.</li>\\n            <li>Transition & integration (10\\u201315 min) \\u2014 soft tones guide you back; optional journaling.</li>\\n            <li>Sharing & scheduling (5 min) \\u2014 time for questions and next steps.</li>\\n          </ol>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <section aria-labelledby=\\\"contra\\\">\\n          <h3 id=\\\"contra\\\">Contraindications & note</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted-note\\\">Sound baths are restorative but not suitable for everyone. Please consult if you have recent head injury, epilepsy, pacemaker, or are in early pregnancy. This is not a substitute for medical care. Contact us if you\\u2019re unsure.</p>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-top:16px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"dots\\\"><span class=\\\"dot\\\"></span><span class=\\\"dot\\\" style=\\\"transform:scale(0.85)\\\"></span><span class=\\\"dot\\\" style=\\\"transform:scale(0.7)\\\"></span></div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-size:14px;color:#8A6E5A\\\">Prefer to chat? Call <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong> or email <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"contact-panel\\\" aria-label=\\\"Contact form\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:12px\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <div class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">Book or ask a question</div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:#4A3426\\\">Schedule with {{FACILITATOR_NAME}}</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style=\\\"text-align:right\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:#7A6458\\\">Next event:</div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:800;color:#4A3426\\\">{{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}}</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <form action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}/contact-submit\\\" method=\\\"post\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"field\\\"><label for=\\\"name\\\">Full name</label><input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" required placeholder=\\\"Your name\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"field\\\"><label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label><input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" required placeholder=\\\"you@domain.com\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"field\\\"><label for=\\\"phone\\\">Phone</label><input id=\\\"phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" placeholder=\\\"Optional\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"field\\\"><label for=\\\"type\\\">I'm contacting about</label>\\n            <select id=\\\"type\\\" name=\\\"type\\\">\\n              <option>Group event / public gathering</option>\\n              <option>Private 1:1 session</option>\\n              <option>Couples session</option>\\n              <option>Corporate or retreat booking</option>\\n              <option>Questions / other</option>\\n            </select>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"field\\\"><label for=\\\"msg\\\">Message</label><textarea id=\\\"msg\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"Tell us about your goals, preferred dates, or accessibility needs\\\"></textarea></div>\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:10px\\\">\\n            <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:#8A6E5A\\\">Response within 48 hours</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </form>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;color:#7A6458\\\">We prioritize safety and intimacy. For private bookings, please include preferred dates and the number of guests so we can reserve the right space at {{VENUE_NAME}}.</div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <section>\\n      <h2>Myths vs. truths about sound baths</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"grid-3\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>Myth</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:6px 0 0\\\">Sound baths will force sleep.</p>\\n          <hr style=\\\"border:none;border-top:1px dashed #EDE1D8;margin:10px 0\\\">\\n          <strong>Truth</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:6px 0 0\\\">While many drift into a rested state, the experience is about embodied listening and nervous system regulation. Wakeful integration is common.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>Myth</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:6px 0 0\\\">Loud instruments are always used.</p>\\n          <hr style=\\\"border:none;border-top:1px dashed #EDE1D8;margin:10px 0\\\">\\n          <strong>Truth</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:6px 0 0\\\">We curate dynamics intentionally. Soft crystal tones, tuning forks, and monochord drones are layered with space to breathe.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>Myth</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:6px 0 0\\\">One session fits all.</p>\\n          <hr style=\\\"border:none;border-top:1px dashed #EDE1D8;margin:10px 0\\\">\\n          <strong>Truth</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:6px 0 0\\\">Each offering is designed for its container\\u2014community gatherings differ from 1:1 immersions and corporate sound meditations.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section>\\n      <h2>Our pillars</h2>\\n      <ul class=\\\"grid-3\\\" style=\\\"list-style:none;padding:0;margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <li class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h4>Attention to nuance</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted-note\\\">We listen to the room, adjusting tone, volume and silence for a premium sensory experience.</p>\\n        </li>\\n        <li class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h4>Safety & integrity</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted-note\\\">Trauma-informed facilitation and accessibility options are woven into every event\\u2014your comfort is primary.</p>\\n        </li>\\n        <li class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h4>Embodied ritual</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted-note\\\">Intention setting, breathwork and integration create a container for transformation, not a fleeting effect.</p>\\n        </li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section>\\n      <h2>Case notes & reflections</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"case-notes\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"testimonial\\\">\\n          <strong>\\\"A transformative calm\\\"</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:8px 0 0\\\">\\\"The layering of tuning forks and chimes created such spaciousness. I felt seen and softened for days.\\\" \\u2014 A., retreat participant</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"testimonial\\\">\\n          <strong>\\\"Perfect for our team\\\"</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:8px 0 0\\\">\\\"We booked a corporate session and the monochord work gave everyone a shared pause that improved focus afterward.\\\" \\u2014 J., HR Manager</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section>\\n      <h2>Frequently asked</h2>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <details style=\\\"margin-bottom:8px\\\"><summary style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">How long are group sound baths?</summary>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted-note\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Typical public offerings are 60\\u201390 minutes including an arrival buffer. Private sessions can be tailored from 45 to 120 minutes.</div>\\n        </details>\\n        <details style=\\\"margin-bottom:8px\\\"><summary style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Which instruments do you use?</summary>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted-note\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Our palette may include crystal bowls, chimes, tuning forks, gongs, and the monochord. For private bookings we curate an instrument mix that supports your goals.</div>\\n        </details>\\n        <details style=\\\"margin-bottom:8px\\\"><summary style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Can I bring a friend?</summary>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted-note\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Yes\\u2014for group events bring friends and for private sessions you can book couples or small groups; let us know headcount when contacting.</div>\\n        </details>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px;border-radius:12px;padding:18px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#FFF8F5,#FFF4EF);box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(192,122,82,0.06)\\\">\\n      <h2>Ready to resonate?</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"muted-note\\\">Select a time, ask a question, or request a bespoke immersive day. We\\u2019ll respond and help you choose the right container.</p>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <footer>\\n    <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:800;color:#4A3426\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-size:13px\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div style=\\\"text-align:right\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Contact</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-size:13px\\\">{{PHONE}} • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"Contact page and usage notes for sound_bath project (chunk 4)\\n\\nFiles in this chunk:\\n- contact.html  -> A full, sensory-focused contact page for {{BUSINESS_NAME}} with hero, myth_vs_truth, pillars, case_notes, faq, and cta sections included.\\n- README.md     -> This file.\\n\\nPurpose:\\n- Use contact.html as the primary Connect/Contact page in the site. It contains a contact form (posts to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}/contact-submit), phone and email placeholders, what-to-bring guidance, contraindications, flow description, instrument notes, and a CTA.\\n\\nPlaceholders to replace in your deployment:\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\n- {{TAGLINE}}\\n- {{PHONE}}\\n- {{EMAIL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\n- {{CITY}}\\n- {{STATE}}\\n- {{FACILITATOR_NAME}}\\n- {{VENUE_NAME}}\\n- {{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}}\\n\\nDesign notes:\\n- Visual richness is achieved with an inline SVG background and warm gradients; no external assets are referenced.\\n- The page follows the earthy_warm layout family and a playful_premium voice.\\n- The contact form includes options for group, private, couples, and corporate bookings.\\n\\nAccessibility & content:\\n- Includes a clear contraindications disclaimer; please ensure this text is reviewed by your practitioner.\\n- \\\"What to bring\\\" and session flow are present so guests know what to expect.\\n\\nHow to integrate:\\n- Drop contact.html into your site root or route it to '/contact'. Update placeholders and the form endpoint.\\n- If you want a separate assets/svg file, extract the inline <svg> from contact.html into assets/img/pattern.svg and update styles accordingly.\\n\\nEnd of chunk 4.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
